200-990f-af25007f7f9d\\\"><th data-local-id=\\\"c7309741-a8a4-41bc-9964-500323be6d45\\\"><p data-local-id=\\\"ba12d14be2c4\\\">Effective date</p></th><td data-local-id=\\\"7440ab9d-11bf-49c2-92bb-f626b5856d71\\\"><p data-local-id=\\\"ef3fa10ba097\\\">2026-08-01</p></td></tr><tr data-local-id=\\\"95735aef-decf-44fb-b882-9fbbfe784433\\\"><th data-local-id=\\\"bd5d1b7f-7283-466c-80d2-226cf385c07d\\\"><p data-local-id=\\\"912638e23164\\\">Review date</p></th><td data-local-id=\\\"3546e46a-5a8f-4331-b907-a40d1236dc0d\\\"><p data-local-id=\\\"eae23e756282\\\">2027-08-01</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 data-local-id=\\\"d3fc943c73de\\\">Retention</h2><p data-local-id=\\\"4861842bdc35\\\">7.1 Customer data is retained for the duration of the contract and deleted within 30 days after the contract ends, unless the customer requests earlier deletion.</p><p data-local-id=\\\"108e935c27ba\\\">7.2 Backups are retained for 35 days and then deleted automatically.</p><p data-local-id=\\\"26b4d97f9997\\\">7.3 Audit logs are retained for 1 year.</p><h2 data-local-id=\\\"a9a019a5bb37\\\">Disposal</h2><p data-local-id=\\\"2b773608b04a\\\">7.4 On request, deletion of customer data from primary systems is confirmed to the customer in writing.</p><p data-local-id=\\\"49f5ba21f5a6\\\">7.5 Decommissioned storage is sanitized through the cloud provider&#39;s media sanitization process. Halcyon Ridge Software operates no physical storage media.</p>\"},\"metadata\":{\"hasSpaceInstructions\":false,\"totalViews\":4,\"authorId\":\"712020:00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004\",\"version\":{\"number\":1,\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-12T17:38:54.177Z\",\"message\":\"\"}}}}",
